# Tic-Tac-Toe Game

## About the Project
This project is a two-player Tic-Tac-Toe game developed using Python
as part of my Python Developer Internship at Intern Infobyte.

Players take turns placing X and O on a 3x3 board.
The game checks for winning combinations and identifies a tie
when all cells are filled without a winner.

## Features
- Interactive 3x3 game board
- Two-player gameplay
- Automatic winner detection
- Tie detection
- Input validation
- Option to play again

## Technologies Used
- Python 3

## How to Run

1. Install Python 3.
2. Download or clone this repository.
3. Open a terminal in the project folder.
4. Run the command:

   python tic_tac_toe.py

